WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:03.035
Lesson nine. Seasons!

2
00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:11.160
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.848
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.898 --> 00:00:17.883
Today we learn: Seasons! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.884
Spring! Say it with me. Spring!

6
00:00:25.844 --> 00:00:29.111
Summer! Say it with me. Summer!

7
00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:36.843
Autumn! Say it with me. Autumn!

8
00:00:40.844 --> 00:00:44.344
Winter! Say it with me. Winter!

9
00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:52.067
Hot! Say it with me. Hot!

10
00:00:55.985 --> 00:00:59.251
Cold! Say it with me. Cold!

11
00:01:03.324 --> 00:01:06.708
Rain! Say it with me. Rain!

12
00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:14.119
Snow! Say it with me. Snow!

13
00:01:18.197 --> 00:01:25.956
Listen. In spring, flowers grow. In winter, it is cold.

14
00:01:26.006 --> 00:01:32.190
Say it with me. In spring, flowers grow. In winter, it is cold.

15
00:01:36.977 --> 00:01:42.912
Flowers bloom in spring, and it is hot in summer. Leaves fall in autumn before cold winter.

16
00:01:42.962 --> 00:01:44.265
I like this story!

17
00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:50.498
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.548 --> 00:01:51.698
Autumn!

19
00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:57.948
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:57.998 --> 00:01:59.148
Cold!

21
00:01:59.938 --> 00:02:06.862
Value corner: Responsibility. Taking care of our things and our jobs shows responsibility.

22
00:02:06.912 --> 00:02:08.950
I can show responsibility too!

23
00:02:09.852 --> 00:02:17.410
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.100
Bye-bye, friends!

